msgstr "PbTe (非解析補正 (non-analytic correction))"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:12
msgid "At a glance"
msgstr "概要"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst
msgid "Goal"
msgstr "目標"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:15
msgid ""
"Include the non-analytic correction in the phonon dispersion of the polar"
" semiconductor PbTe."
msgstr "極性半導体 PbTe のフォノン分散に非解析補正を取り入れます。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst
msgid "You will learn"
msgstr "学べること"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:17
msgid ""
"how to let **alm** build the supercell from the primitive cell with "
":alm:`SUPERCELL`"
msgstr ":alm:`SUPERCELL` を用いて **alm** に基本セルからスーパーセルを構築させる方法"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:18
msgid ""
"how to create the displaced structures with ``displace.py`` from the "
"primitive ``POSCAR``"
msgstr "基本セルの ``POSCAR`` から ``displace.py`` で変位構造を作成する方法"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:19
msgid ""
"how to create the :anphon:`BORNINFO` file (dielectric tensor and Born "
"effective charges) from a DFPT calculation"
msgstr "DFPT 計算から :anphon:`BORNINFO` ファイル (誘電テンソルとボルン有効電荷) を作成する方法"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:20
msgid "how the :anphon:`NONANALYTIC` options 1, 2, and 3 differ"
msgstr ":anphon:`NONANALYTIC` オプション 1、2、3 の違い"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:21
msgid ""
"VASP (the VASP outputs are provided in ``vasp_outputs/``) and ``PyYAML`` "
"(used by ``displace.py``)."
msgstr ""
"VASP (VASP の出力は ``vasp_outputs/`` に用意されています) と ``PyYAML`` "
"(``displace.py`` が使用します)。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst
msgid "Example files"
msgstr "例のファイル"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:22
msgid "``example/PbTe``"
msgstr "``example/PbTe``"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:24
msgid ""
"This part demonstrates how to include the non-analytic correction in "
"phonon and thermal conductivity calculations of polar semiconductors."
msgstr "この章では、極性半導体のフォノンおよび熱伝導率 (thermal conductivity) 計算において非解析補正を取り入れる方法を解説します。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:26
msgid ""
"All input files can be found at the **example/PbTe** subdirectory. The "
"VASP inputs are in ``vasp_inputs/``, the VASP outputs of the force "
"calculations in ``vasp_outputs/``, and the files generated in each step "
"in ``reference/``, so you can skip any step by copying the corresponding "
"file."
msgstr ""
"すべての入力ファイルは **example/PbTe** サブディレクトリにあります。VASP の入力は ``vasp_inputs/`` "
"に、力の計算の VASP 出力は ``vasp_outputs/`` に、各ステップで生成されるファイルは ``reference/`` "
"にあるので、対応するファイルをコピーすれば任意のステップを省略できます。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:30
msgid "Let's move to the example directory"
msgstr "それでは example ディレクトリに移動しましょう。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:39
msgid "1. Build a supercell and generate displacements"
msgstr "1. スーパーセル (supercell) を構築し、変位 (displacement) を生成する"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:41
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, we build a 4x4x4 supercell of the primitive cell of "
"PbTe containing 2 atoms. The crystal structure of the primitive cell in "
"the VASP POSCAR format is"
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアル (tutorial) では、2 原子を含む PbTe の基本セル (primitive cell) の 4x4x4 "
"スーパーセルを構築します。VASP POSCAR 形式における基本セルの結晶構造は次のとおりです。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:46
msgid ":download:`Download POSCAR <../../../example/PbTe/vasp_inputs/POSCAR>`"
msgstr ":download:`POSCAR をダウンロード <../../../example/PbTe/vasp_inputs/POSCAR>`"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:48
msgid ""
"The lattice constant :math:`a = 6.4431` Å was obtained by relaxing the "
"primitive cell with the PBEsol functional (``INCAR.relax`` and "
"``KPOINTS.relax`` in ``vasp_inputs/``; the relaxation was run twice, the "
"second time starting from the ``CONTCAR`` of the first, which left a "
"residual stress of 0.003 kB). This step is optional here, since the "
"relaxed ``POSCAR`` is provided, but for your own material, please relax "
"the primitive cell first with the same DFT settings as the force "
"calculations: phonon frequencies of polar materials are sensitive to the "
"lattice constant."
msgstr ""
"格子定数 :math:`a = 6.4431` Å は、PBEsol 汎関数を用いて基本セルを緩和して得たものです "
"(``vasp_inputs/`` の ``INCAR.relax`` と ``KPOINTS.relax``。緩和は 2 回行い、2 回目は 1"
" 回目の ``CONTCAR`` から開始しました。残留応力は 0.003 kB です)。ここでは緩和済みの ``POSCAR`` "
"が用意されているのでこのステップは省略できますが、ご自身の物質では、まず力の計算と同じ DFT "
"設定で基本セルを緩和してください。極性物質のフォノン振動数は格子定数に敏感です。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:53
msgid "Copy the primitive cell to the working directory"
msgstr "基本セルを作業ディレクトリにコピーします"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:59
msgid ""
"We do not need to build the supercell ourselves. **alm** builds it from "
"the input structure with the :alm:`SUPERCELL` tag. The input for **alm** "
"(``ALM0.in``) is"
msgstr ""
"スーパーセルを自分で作成する必要はありません。**alm** が :alm:`SUPERCELL` "
"タグを用いて入力構造からスーパーセルを構築します。**alm** の入力 (``ALM0.in``) は次のとおりです。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:64
msgid ":download:`Download ALM0.in <../../../example/PbTe/ALM0.in>`"
msgstr ":download:`ALM0.in をダウンロード <../../../example/PbTe/ALM0.in>`"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:66
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Here, :alm:`STRUCTURE_FILE` reads the lattice vectors, the elements, and "
"the atomic positions from ``POSCAR``, so ``&cell`` and ``&position`` are "
"not needed. :ref:`SUPERCELL = 4 <alm_supercell>` means a 4x4x4 supercell "
"of the input cell, :math:`(\\boldsymbol{a}_s, \\boldsymbol{b}_s, "
"\\boldsymbol{c}_s) = 4(\\boldsymbol{a}_p, \\boldsymbol{b}_p, "
"\\boldsymbol{c}_p)`, which contains 128 atoms. Since :alm:`PRIMCELL` is "
"not given, it takes the default value (identity matrix), and the input "
"cell itself is used as the primitive cell. ``NORDER = 1`` and ``*-* "
"None`` select the harmonic force constants without a cutoff radius."
msgstr ""
"ここで、:alm:`STRUCTURE_FILE` により格子ベクトル、元素、原子位置が ``POSCAR`` "
"から読み込まれるので、``&cell`` と ``&position`` は不要です。:ref:`SUPERCELL = 4 "
"<alm_supercell>` は入力セルの 4x4x4 スーパーセル :math:`(\\boldsymbol{a}_s, "
"\\boldsymbol{b}_s, \\boldsymbol{c}_s) = 4(\\boldsymbol{a}_p, "
"\\boldsymbol{b}_p, \\boldsymbol{c}_p)` を意味し、128 原子を含みます。:alm:`PRIMCELL` "
"は指定していないのでデフォルト値 (単位行列) となり、入力セルそのものが基本セルとして使われます。``NORDER = 1`` と ``*-* "
"None`` により、カットオフ半径なしの調和力定数が選択されます。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:72
msgid "Run **alm** to obtain the displacement patterns"
msgstr "**alm** を実行して変位パターンを求めます"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:78
msgid ""
"This finishes quickly and writes the two displacement patterns to "
"``pbte444.pattern_HARMONIC``. Then, create the displaced structures with "
"``displace.py``"
msgstr ""
"これはすぐに終わり、2 つの変位パターンが ``pbte444.pattern_HARMONIC`` "
"に書き出されます。次に、``displace.py`` で変位構造を作成します"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:85
msgid ""
"Note that the primitive ``POSCAR`` is given, not a supercell. "
"``displace.py`` reads the supercell built by **alm** from the header of "
"the pattern file, so it needs ``PyYAML``. It generates two displaced "
"supercells (``harm1.POSCAR`` and ``harm2.POSCAR``) with a displacement of"
" 0.01 Å, together with the supercell without displacements "
"(``SPOSCAR0``), which is used as the reference structure in the next "
"step."
msgstr ""
"スーパーセルではなく基本セルの ``POSCAR`` を与えている点に注意してください。``displace.py`` は **alm** "
"が構築したスーパーセルをパターンファイルのヘッダーから読み込むため、``PyYAML`` が必要です。0.01 Å の変位を加えた 2 "
"つのスーパーセル (``harm1.POSCAR`` と ``harm2.POSCAR``) と、変位のないスーパーセル "
"(``SPOSCAR0``) が生成されます。``SPOSCAR0`` は次のステップで参照構造として使われます。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:93
msgid "2. Run DFT calculations and get forces"
msgstr "2. DFT 計算を実行し、力 (force) を得る"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:95
msgid ""
"Next, please perform DFT calculation and compute forces for the two "
"displaced configurations. The ``INCAR`` and ``KPOINTS.super`` (a "
":math:`2\\times 2\\times 2` :math:`\\Gamma`-centered mesh for the "
"supercell) are in ``vasp_inputs/``. The calculations can be done, for "
"example, as"
msgstr ""
"次に、2 つの変位配置について DFT 計算を行い、力を計算してください。``INCAR`` と ``KPOINTS.super`` "
"(スーパーセル用の :math:`2\\times 2\\times 2` の :math:`\\Gamma` 中心メッシュ) は "
"``vasp_inputs/`` にあります。計算は例えば次のように行えます。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:114
msgid ""
"Here, the last line restores the primitive ``POSCAR``, which is used by "
"**alm** in the next step. When all calculations are done, please collect "
"the displacement-force datasets as"
msgstr ""
"ここで、最後の行は基本セルの ``POSCAR`` を元に戻します。これは次のステップで **alm** "
"が使用します。すべての計算が終わったら、次のように変位-力データセットを収集してください。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:121
msgid ""
"The reference structure must be ``SPOSCAR0``, not the primitive "
"``POSCAR``: ``extract.py`` computes the displacements by comparing the "
"atomic positions in ``vasprun_?.xml`` with those in the reference "
"structure atom by atom, so the reference must be the undisplaced "
"supercell with the same atom order as the supercell built by **alm**."
msgstr ""
"参照構造は基本セルの ``POSCAR`` ではなく ``SPOSCAR0`` でなければなりません。``extract.py`` は "
"``vasprun_?.xml`` の原子位置を参照構造の原子位置と原子ごとに比較して変位を計算するので、参照構造は **alm** "
"が構築したスーパーセルと同じ原子の順序をもつ、変位のないスーパーセルである必要があります。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:125
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, we have placed the VASP outputs in ``vasp_outputs/`` "
"directory, so you can skip the VASP calculations by using the "
"``vasprun_?.xml`` files in that directory as"
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアルでは VASP の出力を ``vasp_outputs/`` ディレクトリに置いてあるので、そのディレクトリにある "
"``vasprun_?.xml`` ファイルを次のように使うことで VASP 計算を省略できます。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:131
msgid "``reference/SPOSCAR0`` and ``reference/DFSET_harmonic`` are also provided."
msgstr "``reference/SPOSCAR0`` と ``reference/DFSET_harmonic`` も用意されています。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:136
msgid "3. Fit second-order force constants"
msgstr "3. 2 次の力定数 (force constant) をフィッティングする"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:138
msgid ""
"The input for the fitting (``ALM1.in``) is the same as ``ALM0.in`` except"
" for ``MODE = optimize`` and the ``&optimize`` field."
msgstr ""
"フィッティング用の入力 (``ALM1.in``) は、``MODE = optimize`` と ``&optimize`` フィールドを除いて"
" ``ALM0.in`` と同じです。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:142
msgid ":download:`Download ALM1.in <../../../example/PbTe/ALM1.in>`"
msgstr ":download:`ALM1.in をダウンロード <../../../example/PbTe/ALM1.in>`"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:144
msgid "Please run"
msgstr "次を実行し、"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:150
msgid ""
"and check if the fitting error in the log file (``ALM1.log``) is "
"reasonably small (1.24% in ``reference/ALM1.log``). The second-order "
"force constants are saved in ``pbte444.h5``, which also stores the "
"crystal structure and is used by **anphon** below. A pre-generated "
"``pbte444.h5`` is provided in ``reference/``."
msgstr ""
"ログファイル (``ALM1.log``) のフィッティング誤差が十分に小さいことを確認してください "
"(``reference/ALM1.log`` では 1.24%)。2 次の力定数は ``pbte444.h5`` "
"に保存されます。このファイルには結晶構造も格納されており、以下で **anphon** が使用します。生成済みの ``pbte444.h5`` が"
" ``reference/`` に用意されています。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:157
msgid "4. Compute dielectric tensor and Born effective charges"
msgstr "4. 誘電テンソル (dielectric tensor) とボルン有効電荷 (Born effective charges) を計算する"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:159
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"To include the non-analytic correction, one needs to give the electronic "
"permittivity tensor (:math:`\\epsilon_{\\infty}`) and the Born effective "
"charges. This can be done conveniently using density functional "
"perturbation theory (DFPT), which is available in major DFT codes (e.g., "
"VASP, Quantum-ESPRESSO, abinit)."
msgstr ""
"非解析補正を取り入れるには、電子的誘電率テンソル (electronic permittivity tensor) "
"(:math:`\\epsilon_{\\infty}`) とボルン有効電荷を与える必要があります。これは密度汎関数摂動論 (density "
"functional perturbation theory, DFPT) を使えば簡単に行え、主要な DFT コード (例: VASP, "
"Quantum-ESPRESSO, abinit) で利用できます。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:162
msgid ""
"In VASP, for example, you just need to add `LEPSILON = .True. "
"<https://www.vasp.at/wiki/index.php/LEPSILON>`_ in INCAR. For orbital "
"dependent functionals, this option is not supported, and `LCALCEPS = "
".True. <https://www.vasp.at/wiki/index.php/LCALCEPS>`_ should be used "
"instead. The inputs used for this tutorial are ``INCAR.dfpt`` and "
"``KPOINTS.dfpt`` (a :math:`20\\times 20\\times 20` "
":math:`\\Gamma`-centered mesh) in ``vasp_inputs/``, together with the "
"primitive ``POSCAR``."
msgstr ""
"例えば VASP では、INCAR に `LEPSILON = .True. "
"<https://www.vasp.at/wiki/index.php/LEPSILON>`_ "
"を追加するだけです。軌道依存の汎関数ではこのオプションはサポートされておらず、代わりに `LCALCEPS = .True. "
"<https://www.vasp.at/wiki/index.php/LCALCEPS>`_ "
"を使う必要があります。このチュートリアルで用いた入力は、``vasp_inputs/`` の ``INCAR.dfpt`` と "
"``KPOINTS.dfpt`` (:math:`20\\times 20\\times 20` の :math:`\\Gamma` "
"中心メッシュ) および基本セルの ``POSCAR`` です。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:169
msgid ""
"Please run a DFPT calculation using the same primitive cell (``POSCAR``) "
"that you gave to **alm** to generate the supercell. If these two "
"structures are inconsistent, the order of the atoms and Born effective "
"charges may change, which likely results in strange phonon band "
"dispersion."
msgstr ""
"スーパーセルの生成のために **alm** に与えたものと同じ基本セル (``POSCAR``) を用いて DFPT "
"計算を実行してください。これら 2 "
"つの構造が一致していないと、原子やボルン有効電荷の順序が変わってしまい、おそらく不自然なフォノンバンド分散を招くことになります。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:171
msgid ""
"Once the DFPT calculation finishes, please parse the electronic "
"permittivity tensor and Born effective charges from the output file and "
"save them in a single file following the specific format described in "
":ref:`label_format_BORNINFO`."
msgstr ""
"DFPT "
"計算が終わったら、出力ファイルから電子的誘電率テンソルとボルン有効電荷を読み取り、:ref:`label_format_BORNINFO` "
"に記載された特定の形式に従って 1 つのファイルに保存してください。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:173
msgid "If you used VASP, the :anphon:`BORNINFO` file can be created by issuing"
msgstr "VASP を使った場合は、次を実行することで :anphon:`BORNINFO` ファイルを作成できます。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:179
msgid ""
"Here, ``POSCAR`` is the primitive cell used in the DFPT calculation, and "
"``vasprun.xml`` is the output of the DFPT calculation. This parsing "
"feature is supported only for VASP and Quantum-ESPRESSO."
msgstr ""
"ここで ``POSCAR`` は DFPT 計算で使用した基本セル、``vasprun.xml`` は DFPT "
"計算の出力です。この読み取り機能は VASP と Quantum-ESPRESSO のみでサポートされています。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:182
msgid ""
"We provide the pre-generated file ``PbTe.born`` in the ``reference/`` "
"directory, so you can copy it to the working directory to move forward. "
"It gives :math:`\\epsilon_{\\infty} = 30.40` and "
":math:`Z^{*}_{\\mathrm{Pb}} = -Z^{*}_{\\mathrm{Te}} = 5.88`. The Born "
"effective charge changes by about 0.6% from a :math:`12\\times 12\\times "
"12` to the :math:`20\\times 20\\times 20` mesh, so please check the "
":math:`k`-point convergence for your own system."
msgstr ""
"生成済みのファイル ``PbTe.born`` を ``reference/`` "
"ディレクトリに用意しているので、これを作業ディレクトリにコピーして先に進むこともできます。このファイルでは "
":math:`\\epsilon_{\\infty} = 30.40`、:math:`Z^{*}_{\\mathrm{Pb}} = "
"-Z^{*}_{\\mathrm{Te}} = 5.88` です。ボルン有効電荷は :math:`12\\times 12\\times 12` "
"メッシュから :math:`20\\times 20\\times 20` メッシュで約 0.6% 変化するので、ご自身の系では "
":math:`k` 点の収束を確認してください。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:189
msgid "5. Phonon calculations"
msgstr "5. フォノン計算"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:191
msgid "All inputs are ready, so we can start phonon calculations."
msgstr "すべての入力が揃ったので、フォノン計算を開始できます。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:193
msgid ""
"We first compute phonon dispersion without non-analytic (NA) correction. "
"The input file for **anphon** (``phband.in``) looks like"
msgstr ""
"まず、非解析 (NA) 補正なしでフォノン分散を計算します。**anphon** 用の入力ファイル (``phband.in``) "
"は次のようになります。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:198
msgid ":download:`Download phband.in <../../../example/PbTe/reference/phband.in>`"
msgstr ":download:`phband.in をダウンロード <../../../example/PbTe/reference/phband.in>`"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:200
msgid ""
"The crystal structure is read from ``pbte444.h5``, so ``&cell`` and "
":anphon:`KD` are not needed. Copy it to the working directory (if you "
"skipped the previous steps, copy ``reference/pbte444.h5`` and "
"``reference/PbTe.born`` as well)."
msgstr ""
"結晶構造は ``pbte444.h5`` から読み込まれるので、``&cell`` と :anphon:`KD` "
"は不要です。このファイルを作業ディレクトリにコピーしてください (前のステップを省略した場合は、``reference/pbte444.h5`` "
"と ``reference/PbTe.born`` もコピーしてください)。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:203
msgid "Please run **anphon** and plot the bands file"
msgstr "**anphon** を実行し、bands ファイルをプロットしてください。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:215
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"We can see that the TO and LO phonons are degenerate at "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=0` and the optical phonon frequencies go down "
"rapidly as :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}\\longrightarrow 0`. All three optical "
"modes are at 42.4 cm\\ :sup:`-1` at :math:`\\Gamma`."
msgstr ""
"TO フォノンと LO フォノンが :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=0` "
"で縮退しており、:math:`\\boldsymbol{q}\\longrightarrow 0` "
"に近づくにつれて光学フォノンの振動数が急速に低下する様子が分かります。:math:`\\Gamma` 点では 3 つの光学モードはすべて 42.4"
" cm\\ :sup:`-1` です。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:217
msgid ""
"Next, let us consider the NA correction. Please change the "
":anphon:`PREFIX` and :anphon:`NONANALYTIC` tags as"
msgstr ""
"次に、NA 補正を考慮しましょう。:anphon:`PREFIX` と :anphon:`NONANALYTIC` "
"タグを次のように変更してください。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:225
msgid ""
"This option activates Parlinski's approach with the damping factor of "
":math:`\\sigma = 0.15`. After running **anphon** again, we can compare "
"phonon dispersion curves with and without the NA correction."
msgstr ""
"このオプションは、減衰係数 :math:`\\sigma = 0.15` を用いた Parlinski の手法を有効にします。再び "
"**anphon** を実行すると、NA 補正の有無によるフォノン分散曲線を比較できます。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:237
msgid ""
"The LO-TO splitting occurs as expected: the LO frequency at "
":math:`\\Gamma` is now 111.3 cm\\ :sup:`-1`, while the TO frequency stays"
" at 42.4 cm\\ :sup:`-1`."
msgstr ""
"期待どおり LO-TO 分裂が生じます。:math:`\\Gamma` 点の LO 振動数は 111.3 cm\\ :sup:`-1` "
"となり、TO 振動数は 42.4 cm\\ :sup:`-1` のままです。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:239
msgid ""
"Please repeat the above calculations with the other :anphon:`NONANALYTIC`"
" options (``NONANALYTIC=2`` (mixed-space) and ``NONANALYTIC=3`` (Ewald "
"method)). Finally, we plot all results together to see the difference."
msgstr ""
"他の :anphon:`NONANALYTIC` オプション (``NONANALYTIC=2`` (混合空間法) および "
"``NONANALYTIC=3`` (Ewald 法)) "
"でも上記の計算を繰り返してください。最後に、すべての結果をまとめてプロットし、その違いを確認します。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:256
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"We can see that ``NONANALYTIC = 2`` and ``NONANALYTIC = 3`` give smoother"
" dispersion than ``NONANALYTIC = 1``. For these two methods,the NA "
"correction becomes exactly zero at the commensurate "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` points (other than "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}\\longrightarrow 0`). In the present calculation, "
"we used a 4x4x4 supercell of the primitive cell. Hence, the NA correction"
" should be zero at the Brillouin zone boundaries (X and L points) as well"
" as the midpoint of each high-symmetry line (e.g., "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=(1/4, 1/4, 0)`). We can confirm this from the "
"above figure, where the blue, red, and magenta curves perfectly intersect"
" with each other at these commensurate points. The ``NONANALYTIC = 1`` "
"result (green) instead shows unphysical dips of the LO branch between "
":math:`\\Gamma` and the zone boundaries, which are an artifact of this "
"approach."
msgstr ""
"``NONANALYTIC = 2`` と ``NONANALYTIC = 3`` は ``NONANALYTIC = 1`` "
"よりも滑らかな分散を与えることが分かります。これら 2 "
"つの手法では、(:math:`\\boldsymbol{q}\\longrightarrow 0` を除く) 整合的な "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{q}` 点で NA 補正が厳密にゼロになります。今回の計算では、基本セルの 4x4x4 "
"スーパーセルを使用しました。したがって、NA 補正はブリルアンゾーン (Brillouin zone) 境界 (X 点と L 点) "
"および各高対称線の中点 (例: :math:`\\boldsymbol{q}=(1/4, 1/4, 0)`) "
"でゼロになるはずです。これは上図から確認でき、青・赤・マゼンタの曲線はこれらの整合点で互いに完全に交差しています。一方、``NONANALYTIC"
" = 1`` の結果 (緑) では、:math:`\\Gamma` 点とゾーン境界の間で LO "
"分枝に非物理的なくぼみが現れますが、これはこの手法に起因するものです。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/pbte_nonanalytic_correction.rst:259
msgid ""
"In general, we recommend using ``NONANALYTIC = 3`` as it correctly "
"separates the short- and long-range terms and calculates the NA "
"correction in the reciprocal space accurately using the Ewald summation "
"method. It can also avoid abrupt jumps or discontinuities in dispersion "
"curves at Brillouin zone boundaries, which can happen with ``NONANALYTIC "
"= 2`` when the BZ boundary is not commensurate with the supercell size."
msgstr ""
"一般に、``NONANALYTIC = 3`` の使用を推奨します。これは短距離項と長距離項を正しく分離し、Ewald 総和法を用いて逆空間で "
"NA 補正を正確に計算するためです。また、BZ 境界がスーパーセルのサイズと整合しない場合に ``NONANALYTIC = 2`` "
"で起こり得る、ブリルアンゾーン境界での分散曲線の急激な飛びや不連続を回避できます。"

